# The script that takes the manual's screenshots ("make EDDEMO=1").
# Copy it to DEMO.SCR beside EDWORD.PRG with DEMO.RTF, LIGHT.IMG and
# NOTES.TXT (see manual/build.sh).
OPEN DEMO.RTF
WIN 0 19 640 381
SHOT main
MENU 0 m_desk
MENU 1 m_file
MENU 3 m_insert
MENU 4 m_font
MENU 5 m_style
MENU 6 m_para
MENU 7 m_tools
MENU 8 m_window
DSHOT about
CMD ABOUT
DSHOT zoompop
CLICK 422 67 1
ZOOM 150
SHOT zoom
ZOOM 100
CMD SPLIT
SHOT split
CMD VCODES
SHOT quick
CMD VDOC
CMD LIVESPELL
FIND year
KEY 4D 0 0
PAGETOP 0 150
SHOT livespell
DSHOT livepopup
LONGPRESS recieve
GO START
CMD SPELL
SHOT spell
KEY 01 27 0
FIND season
CMD THES
SHOT thes
KEY 01 27 0
CMD FIND
FINDSET boat|boats
SHOT find
KEY 01 27 0
DSHOT page
DEXIT 1
CMD PAGE
DSHOT headfoot
DEXIT 1
CMD HEADFOOT
FIND Harbour race
SHOT table
DSHOT tblprop
DEXIT 1
CMD TBLPROP
FIND Note:
DSHOT indents
DEXIT 1
CMD INDENTS
FIND Warm clothes
SHOT lists
DSHOT summary
CMD SUMMARY
DSHOT prefs
DEXIT 1
CMD PREFS
DSHOT size
DEXIT 1
CMD SIZEOTHER
CMD FONTSEL
SHOT fontsel
KEY 01 27 0
CMD PREVIEW
SHOT preview
KEY 01 27 0
PAGETOP 1 0
SHOT columns
SELOBJ 0
PAGETOP 1 60
SHOT objsel
DSHOT drawprops
DEXIT 3
CMD OBJPROP
CMD OBJEDIT
DRAWSEL 1
SHOT drawedit
KEY 01 27 0
FIND Junior
PICTURE LIGHT.IMG
PAGETOP 1 280
SHOT picture
MENU 2 m_edit
CMD UNDO
CMD REDO
CMD UNDO
CMD IMPORT
TOOLWIN 0 110
SHOT importwin
KEY 01 27 0
CMD EXPORT
TOOLWIN 0 110
SHOT exportwin
KEY 01 27 0
DFILE NOTES.TXT
DSHOT import
DEXIT 1
CMD OPEN
DSHOT export
DEXIT 1
CMD EXPTXT
DFILE DEMO.PDF
DSHOT gauge
CMD PDF
FIND Visitors
DSHOT chartmenu
DEXIT 2
CMD CHART
PAGETOP 1 640
SHOT chart
GO START
CMD RULERS
SHOT rulers
CMD RULERS
GO START
DSHOT tblins
CMD TBLINS
SHOT tblnew
CMD UNDO
CMD NEW
TYPE A second document.\nWindows can be placed side by side or one above the other.
CMD TILEV
SHOT tilev
CMD TILEH
SHOT tileh
QUIT
